# fields, plus (T-12643) the four late-linkage prose flags. `--probe` / `--probe-deferred` keep their pre-existing, DEFINED merge with the
# stdin `probes:` / `probes_deferred:` blocks (a mapping union, not an ambiguity) — deliberately NOT
