# `_last_triage_watermark` precedent), never a second spelling — the two ends of the SPEC-0069 link rule
# diverging is the very defect this alias closes. Widening lives THERE; see its comment for the why.
_CLOSES_FP_RE = triage.FINGERPRINT_SHAPE_RE
_PROP_FOLLOWUP_RE = re.compile(r"^T-\d{4,}$")
# T-11408 leg (c) (<project> X-1083) — the SECOND accepted carrier shape for `--prop-follow-up`. A
# followup (`fu_` + 12 hex) is the kernel's OWN carrier for consequent work (SPEC-0095), and
# `task file --promotes` already accepts exactly this shape, so refusing it here made the honest
