                        _lp_msg + "\n\n"
                        "Sanctioned direct-to-main self-commit (T-11162 / X-0930 / X-0922): a settle\n"
                        "runs on an already-DONE card, which by construction has no writing worktree —\n"
                        "so there is no batch and no land to carry this write, and a dirty tasks/*.yaml\n"
                        "sits in land's non-bookkeeping set and wedges EVERY later land in the repo.\n\n"
                        "from: SPEC-0039 + AGENTS-SESSIONS §Writes-happen-in-a-worktree EXCEPTION\n"
                        "(precedents: memory consume T-10307 / memory seed T-10470 / error file\n"
